{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aYour Wife's Pussy\u300b is an R18 NTR RPG game where you play as the heroine Koharu, embarking on an adventure across the vast world of six continents in a rural setting. Face various monsters, events, and bosses, explore diverse ways to earn money to repay debts, and navigate complex interpersonal relationships with multiple endings!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032640/extras/53c5e7f2db055c8eb64e8ad861f0a518.avif?t=1764978354\" width=200 height=85 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Heroine - Koharu</u></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032640/extras/d0450b843117e3b1e36c5f052e279ebe.avif?t=1764978354\" width=388 height=410 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gentle and virtuous housewife who returns to the countryside with her husband Kazuya to run a supply store, taking on the heavy responsibility of repaying debts.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong><u>Koharu's Sister - Reina</u></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032640/extras/bf685ac7b74606ad59b8b353f091320d.avif?t=1764978354\" width=296 height=410 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freshly graduated from university, full of youthful energy, returning to the countryside to seek her own future.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Protagonist - Kazuya</u></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032640/extras/3ce3598dbd1a5e8d011ed1810a9eabeb.avif?t=1764978354\" width=273 height=410 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A man who worked heavy labor in the city for years, physically frail, and tired o